---
title: SEQ-05 — One-way class messaging (UC-16, UC-19)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher as Teacher
    actor Reader as Quran Reader
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Class as Class Service
    participant DB as Database
    alt UC-19 Send to one Reader or whole Class
        Teacher->>App: Select own Class and audience, enter text
        alt Text empty
            App-->>Teacher: Refuse message
        else Text present
            App->>Class: sendAndReadMessages(Teacher, Class, audience, text)
            Class->>DB: Verify Teacher owns Class and read active recipients
            alt Single Reader no longer enrolled
                DB-->>Class: No active recipient
                Class-->>App: Refuse send, store nothing
                App-->>Teacher: Reader unavailable
            else Whole Class has no active Readers
                DB-->>Class: Empty active recipient set
                Class-->>App: Refuse send, store nothing
                App-->>Teacher: Class has no Readers yet
            else Valid recipients
                DB-->>Class: One active Reader or active Class snapshot
                Class->>DB: Atomically store Message and one unread MessageRecipient per Reader
                Note over DB: Audience is one Reader or whole Class, recipients fixed at send time
                DB-->>Class: Sent Message and recipient statuses
                Class-->>App: Sent list with per-recipient read state
                App-->>Teacher: Show sent Message
            end
        end
    else UC-16 Reader opens inbox
        Reader->>App: Open in-app inbox
        App->>Class: sendAndReadMessages(list received, Reader)
        Class->>DB: Read delivered Messages, Teacher display name, Class and unread count
        alt No Messages
            DB-->>Class: Empty inbox
            Class-->>App: Empty state
            App-->>Reader: Show no Messages
        else Messages exist
            DB-->>Class: Newest-first inbox and unread count
            Class-->>App: Inbox
            App-->>Reader: Show Messages without reply control
            Reader->>App: Open Message
            App->>Class: sendAndReadMessages(mark read, Reader, Message)
            Class->>DB: Set this recipient's readAt once
            DB-->>Class: Read date
            Class-->>App: Message text and read state
            App-->>Reader: Show Message
            Note over Class,DB: Teacher's sent view reads the same recipient read date
        end
    end
    Note over Reader,DB: Delivered Messages remain after leaving Class and disappear if Teacher account is deleted
